      { "kind": "other", "text": "The 47% DTI test requires the applicant to compute (housing + debt payments) / gross monthly income -- an arithmetic step, not a self-known fact." },
      { "kind": "documentation", "text": "Bank underwriting -- the loan is issued 'through local banks', which apply their own criteria after SVdP's preliminary screen." }
    ]
  },

